# AI Search Acceptance Dataset — Garáže ND Smíchov (240783160_Garáže_NDS)
# =======================================================================
# FAT/SAT dataset for ONE building site. Every expected_document below was
# confirmed to exist in the production index by a read-only SQL query on
# 2026-08-12; nothing here was invented from the folder naming conventions.
#
# ground_truth_status is "needs_review" on EVERY case and human_verified is
# false on EVERY case, deliberately. "The file is in the index" is not verified
# ground truth: it proves neither that the document is the current revision nor
# that its content answers the question asked. Until a named person signs each
# case off, the acceptance verdict must stay INCONCLUSIVE - see
# benchmark/acceptance_metrics.acceptance_verdict.
#
# verification_method therefore declares the method REQUIRED to sign the case
# off, and human_verified records whether that was actually carried out.
#
# Three queries from the original brief are NEGATIVE cases, not omissions:
#   - kniha betonů        0 hits in document names AND in chunk text
#   - stavební deník      0 as a document; present only as a contractual duty
#                         inside the FERI SoD, which is the trap
#   - výkres bednění      0 hits for "bedn" in any document name
# Writing them as positives would mint permanently red rows; dropping them would
# lose the failure mode most likely to mislead a site manager.
#
# Keyword notes: Czech declension breaks substring matching, so
# expected_answer_keywords use stems ("vodonepropustn", "podkladní beton") or
# stable designations ("TP 124", "21.10.2026") rather than full word forms.
